<td id="S1.T1.2.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t"><span id="S1.T1.2.19.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">CoCo-Bench</span></td>
<td id="S1.T1.2.19.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">✓</td>
