<span id="A4.SS1.p4.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.SS1.p4.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Infix prompt for <math id="A4.SS1.p4.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{CU_{F}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathcolor="#FFFFFF">CU</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;" mathcolor="#FFFFFF" mathvariant="normal">F</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{CU_{F}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A4.SS1.p4.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter"> </span>:</span></span>
